      {
        "id": "_ani8i45r7",
        "number": 4,
        "title": "Ledgers and Lies",
        "real_date": "2026-05-22",
        "world_date": "18th of Ashfall, Year 412",
        "summary": "Acting on a suggestion from ^lord-aldric-thane, the party visited the Hall of Records and enlisted the help of archivist ^wren-ashford. Cross-referencing Compact property filings with tax exemptions Thane remembered approving, Wren identified three properties registered under shell names that all trace back to a single solicitor — one known to work exclusively for ^magistrix-orvenne-lhast. One of the properties is a decommissioned customs house on the north wharf. ^drav-the-fence confirmed that the customs house had been \"very busy\" for the past six months. ^commander-varek-stoneholm issued a warrant for Theron's arrest on a charge of \"arson and civil disruption\" — almost certainly connected to the warehouse job from Session 1.",
        "status": "complete",
        "quests": [
          {
            "_key": "_xasi34ev8",
            "text": "Investigate the decommissioned customs house on the north wharf",
            "status": "active"
