      {
        "id": "_hhez4qlcm",
        "number": 5,
        "title": "The Customs House",
        "real_date": "2026-05-29",
        "world_date": "22nd of Ashfall, Year 412",
        "summary": "The party conducted a reconnaissance of the north wharf customs house before committing to entry. ^pip had already scouted the exterior and identified two guard rotations and a light in the upper floor that never goes out. The plan: enter through the collapsed sea-gate, reach the upper floor, and find proof linking ^magistrix-orvenne-lhast directly to the artefact network. ^wren-ashford provided forged dock-worker credentials as a fallback cover. ^the-hollow-man was sighted on the roof as the party entered — this time he appeared to step aside deliberately rather than raise the alarm. Unclear whose side he is on.",
        "status": "draft",
        "quests": [
          {
            "_key": "_m1xr0z8w3",
