      },
      {
        "id": "_yjr2gpurm",
        "session_id": "_22jk9q9fj",
        "text": "Varek confiscated the body before the party could perform a proper examination — very deliberate",
        "members": [],
        "sort_order": 0,
        "created_at": "2026-05-29T17:11:27.000812+00:00"
      },
      {
        "id": "_dru6h6sqt",
        "session_id": "_22jk9q9fj",
        "text": "Sister Maela noted a faint Pale Flame glyph burned into the courier's palm — not the cause of death",
        "members": [
          "Mira"
        ],
        "sort_order": 1,
        "created_at": "2026-05-29T17:11:27.000812+00:00"
      },
      {
        "id": "_esacmpkm5",
        "session_id": "_22jk9q9fj",
        "text": "Pip confirmed the killer left in a closed carriage bearing no markings",
        "members": [],
        "sort_order": 2,
        "created_at": "2026-05-29T17:11:27.000812+00:00"
      },
      {
        "id": "_k1d7qxyya",
        "session_id": "_22jk9q9fj",
        "text": "The signet ring match to Varek's ring — either he was there or someone stole his identity",
        "members": [
          "Zyx",
          "Theron"
        ],
        "sort_order": 3,
        "created_at": "2026-05-29T17:11:27.000812+00:00"
      },
      {
        "id": "_egm4mm6sm",
        "session_id": "_wob4htma3",
        "text": "Theron entered a collapsing corridor to recover the last acolyte — DC 14 Athletics, rolled 17",
        "members": [
          "Theron"
        ],
        "sort_order": 0,
        "created_at": "2026-05-29T17:11:27.000812+00:00"
      },
      {
        "id": "_vgfihwpr8",
        "session_id": "_wob4htma3",
        "text": "Pip appeared in the burning library — \"Maela said this box was important\" — nearly died",
        "members": [],
        "sort_order": 1,
