        "sort_order": 3,
        "created_at": "2026-05-29T17:11:27.000812+00:00"
      },
      {
        "id": "_tfz01v753",
        "session_id": "_hhez4qlcm",
        "text": "Pip's scouting report was impeccably detailed — she drew a floor plan from memory",
